#X text 82 2618 preset selects a factory tone \, user a slot of the user bank. They go to the tone chosen with edit: A \, or B of a split or mix. The third outlet answers with tonea or toneb \, the bank \, the number and the name. \; store 5 followed by userwrite keeps the edited tone in user slot 5 and on disk. The editor does both with save tone. \; op recalls an operation slot: key mode \, split point \, tone B and the rest of the OPERATION rows. Tone B is loaded from its bank and number., f 64;
#X obj 60 2776 cnv 10 10 10 empty empty Line\ and\ wave 24 6 0 14 #1e3791 #000000 0;
#X text 82 2804 Values of the selected line (line) of the edited tone (edit)., f 64;
#X obj 460 2848 s \$0-cz4;
