#X text 82 5052 achorus (0): chorus for tone A. Values: 0 off \, 1 on. \; bchorus (0): chorus for tone B. Values: 0 off \, 1 on. \; porta (0): notes slide from the last one. Values: 0 off \, 1 on. \; ptime (30): portamento time., f 64;
