#X text 82 5402 bendrange (2): pitch bend range in semitones. \; voices (8): notes of a one-line tone (the CZ: 8) \, a two-line tone plays half as many. \; tune (0): master tune in cents. \; transpose (0): transposition in semitones., f 64;
